k dangerous actions while letting routine ones run unprompted, offering high autonomy at low maintenance cost.","summaryZh":"Anthropic 的 Claude Code 自动模式通过服务端提示注入探针与 Sonnet 4.6 转录分类器双重防护，在拦截危险操作的同时放行常规操作，以低维护成本实现高自主性。"},{"id":"anthropic-harness-design-long-running-apps","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Harness design for long-running apps \\ Anthropic","titleZh":"面向长时间运行应用的多智能体框架设计","published":"2026-03-24T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1774310400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-harness-design-long-running-apps/","image":"","summary":"Separating a generator agent from a skeptical evaluator agent, with concrete grading criteria and context management, substantially improves both subjective frontend design quality and verifiable full-stack software outcomes in long-running autonomous coding.","summaryZh":"将生成智能体与持怀疑态度的评估智能体分离，并配合具体评分标准和上下文管理，可显著提升长时间自主编码中前端设计的主观质量与全栈软件的可验证成果。"},{"id":"qiyingyu-2603.20633","sourceId":"qiyingyu","sourceName":"于琪颖 · ByteDance Seed","title":"Seed1.8 Model Card: Towards Generalized Real-World Agency","titleZh":"Seed1.8 模型卡：迈向通用现实世界代理","published":"2026-03-21T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1774051200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/qiyingyu-2603.20633/","image":"https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2603.20633/assets/x1.png","summary":"Seed1.8 is a foundation model for generalized real-world agency, supporting multi-turn interaction, tool use, and multi-step execution.","summaryZh":"Seed1.8 是一个面向通用现实世界代理的基础模型，支持多轮交互、工具使用和多步执行。"},{"id":"martinwright-beware-fast-tools","sourceId":"martinwright","sourceName":"马丁·赖特","title":"Beware fast tools","titleZh":"当心快速工具——mynameismartin","published":"2026-03-18T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1773792000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/martinwright-beware-fast-tools/","image":"","summary":"Fast tools may lead to shallow thinking and poor quality work.","summaryZh":"快速工具可能导致浅层思考和低质量工作。"},{"id":"tridao-2603.15569","sourceId":"tridao","sourceName":"特里·