/assets/x1.png","summary":"GLM-5 transitions from vibe coding to agentic engineering with DSA and asynchronous RL.","summaryZh":"GLM-5 从氛围编码转向智能体工程，采用 DSA 和异步强化学习。"},{"id":"martinwright-ai-pressure-designer","sourceId":"martinwright","sourceName":"马丁·赖特","title":"How I’m dealing with the pressure to adopt AI as a designer","titleZh":"作为设计师，我如何应对采用 AI 的压力","published":"2026-02-15T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1771113600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/martinwright-ai-pressure-designer/","image":"","summary":"Designers should focus on human-centered skills and use AI as a tool, not a replacement.","summaryZh":"设计师应专注于以人为本的技能，将 AI 作为工具而非替代品。"},{"id":"karpathy-microgpt","sourceId":"karpathy","sourceName":"安德烈·卡帕西 · Eureka Labs","title":"microgpt","titleZh":"microgpt","published":"2026-02-12T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1770854400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/karpathy-microgpt/","image":"","summary":"A single-file, 200-line pure Python implementation of GPT that trains and infers with no dependencies, distilling LLMs to their bare essentials.","summaryZh":"一个仅 200 行纯 Python 代码、无依赖的 GPT 训练与推理实现，将大语言模型精简至核心本质。"},{"id":"stepfun-2602.10604","sourceId":"stepfun","sourceName":"阶跃星辰 · StepFun","title":"Step 3.5 Flash: Open Frontier-Level Intelligence with 11B Active Parameters","titleZh":"Step 3.5 Flash：以 110 亿活跃参数实现前沿级智能","published":"2026-02-11T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1770768000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/stepfun-2602.10604/","image":"https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2602.10604/assets/x4.png","summary":"Step 3.5 Flash achieves frontier-level agentic intelligence with only 11B active parameters through a sparse MoE architecture and scalable RL training.","summaryZh":"Step 3.5 Flash 通过稀疏 MoE 架构和可扩展强化学习训练，仅用 110 亿活跃参数就实现了前沿级智能体智能。"},{"id":"demis-2602.10177","sourceId":"demis","sourceName":"杰米斯·哈萨比斯 · Google DeepMind","title":"Towards Autonomous Mathematics Research","titleZh":"迈向自主数学研究","published":"2026-02-10T00:00:00.000Z","publish