ropic","title":"Building a C compiler with a team of parallel Claudes","titleZh":"用并行 Claude 团队构建 C 编译器","published":"2026-02-05T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1770249600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-building-c-compiler/","image":"","summary":"A team of 16 parallel Claude agents, coordinated via git locks and Docker, built a 100,000-line Rust C compiler that builds Linux 6.9 on x86, ARM, and RISC-V, showing that the main work lies in designing verifiers and parallel work structures around agents.","summaryZh":"16 个并行 Claude 智能体通过 git 锁和 Docker 协调，从零构建出 10 万行 Rust C 编译器，可在 x86、ARM 和 RISC-V 上编译 Linux 6.9，表明关键在于围绕智能体设计验证器与并行工作结构。"},{"id":"kaiming-2602.04770","sourceId":"kaiming","sourceName":"何恺明 · MIT","title":"Generative Modeling via Drifting","titleZh":"通过漂移的生成建模","published":"2026-02-04T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1770163200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/kaiming-2602.04770/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/3ef4677e930b9aba.webp","summary":"Drifting Models evolve the pushforward distribution during training and achieve one-step inference, setting new state-of-the-art FID scores on ImageNet.","summaryZh":"漂移模型在训练过程中演化前推分布，实现单步推理，在 ImageNet 上取得了新的最优 FID 分数。"},{"id":"haifengwang-2602.04705","sourceId":"haifengwang","sourceName":"王海峰 · Baidu","title":"ERNIE 5.0 Technical Report","titleZh":"ERNIE 5.0 技术报告","published":"2026-02-04T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1770163200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/haifengwang-2602.04705/","image":"https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2602.04705/assets/x1.png","summary":"ERNIE 5.0 is a trillion-parameter unified autoregressive model for multimodal understanding and generation, using a novel elastic training paradigm and ultra-sparse MoE architecture.","summaryZh":"ERNIE 5.0 是一个万亿参数的统一自回归模型，支持多模态理解与生成，采用新颖的弹性训练范式和超稀疏 MoE 架构。"},{"id":"zhilinyang-2602.02276","sourceId":"zhilinyang","sourceName":"杨植麟 · Moonshot AI","title":"Kimi K2.5: Visual Agentic Intelligence","titleZh":"Kimi K2.5：视觉智能体智能"