ropic-effective-harnesses-for-long-running-agents","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Effective harnesses for long-running agents","titleZh":"面向长时间运行智能体的有效框架","published":"2025-11-26T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1764115200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-effective-harnesses-for-long-running-agents/","image":"","summary":"A two-part harness with an initializer agent and a coding agent, plus structured feature lists, progress notes, init scripts, and browser-based verification, enables long-running AI agents to make consistent progress across many context windows.","summaryZh":"由初始化智能体与编码智能体组成的双部分框架，配合结构化功能清单、进度笔记、init 脚本和基于浏览器的验证，使长时间运行的 AI 智能体能在多个上下文窗口中保持稳定进展。"},{"id":"xingwusun-2511.18870","sourceId":"xingwusun","sourceName":"孙兴武 · Tencent Hunyuan","title":"HunyuanVideo 1.5 Technical Report","titleZh":"HunyuanVideo 1.5 技术报告","published":"2025-11-24T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1763942400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/xingwusun-2511.18870/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/b0054c3c544b815f.webp","summary":"HunyuanVideo 1.5 achieves state-of-the-art video generation with only 8.3B parameters, enabling efficient inference on consumer GPUs.","summaryZh":"HunyuanVideo 1.5 仅用 83 亿参数实现顶尖视频生成质量，可在消费级 GPU 上高效推理。"},{"id":"anthropic-advanced-tool-use","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Introducing advanced tool use on the Claude Developer Platform","titleZh":"在 Claude 开发者平台引入高级工具使用功能","published":"2025-11-24T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1763942400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-advanced-tool-use/","image":"","summary":"Anthropic's Tool Search Tool, Programmatic Tool Calling, and Tool Use Examples cut token usage by up to 85% and boost tool-selection accuracy, enabling agents to scale to thousands of tools without overloading context.","summaryZh":"Anthropic 的 Tool Search Tool、Programmatic Tool Calling 与 Tool Use Examples 可将 token 消耗最多降低 85% 并提升工具选择准确率，使智能体在数千个工具规模下运行而不撑爆上下文窗